,"html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/commits/26c86ca67ac5b1c4bb82d496dfdef9a91e64f0fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T11:59:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T11:59:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs: document moving average cost, cash and net capital formulas\n\nThe docs described FIFO while both engines use moving average cost.\nDocuments the average cost, cash, net capital and total P&L rules and the\ndata checks, and records the fixes in the changelogs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RT7QLEzoa8patZ52wiC4Av","tree":{"sha":"1dd4e0414c5d132cbfb34e0237ffc79e93419ef7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/git/trees/1dd4e0414c5d132cbfb34e0237ffc79e93419ef7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/git/commits/26c86ca67ac5b1c4bb82d496dfdef9a91e64f0fe","verification":{"payload":"tree 1dd4e0414c5d132cbfb34e0237ffc79e93419ef7\nparent 7e114b2cf389a811fcfb8d89390a1caa0de4b36c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790510365 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790510365 +0000\n\ndocs: document moving average cost, cash and net capital formulas\n\nThe docs described FIFO while both engines use moving average cost.\nDocuments the average cost, cash, net capital and total P&L rules and the\ndata checks, and records the fixes in the changelogs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RT7QLEzoa8patZ52wiC4Av\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKxdQ23L\n8X9sqqZ4pqU50UYoraaPQT7zqGGRLx4VqOnZmdehpM10GbTnPfhXVo8AgqA0AjTdD/UOtGnrkdbd\nwwQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T11:59:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/commit/26c86ca67ac5b1c4bb82d496dfdef9a91e64f0fe","node_id":"C_kwDOL4mo0doAKDI2Yzg2Y2E2N2FjNWIxYzRiYjgyZDQ5NmRmZGVmOWE5MWU2NGYwZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/commit/7e114b2cf389a811fcfb8d89390a1caa0de4b36c","sha":"7e114b2cf389a811fcfb8d89390a1caa0de4b36c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/commits/7e114b2cf389a811fcfb8d89390a1caa0de4b36c"}],"sha":"26c86ca67ac5b1c4bb82d496dfdef9a91e64f0fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/commits/26c86ca67ac5b1c4bb82d496dfdef9a91e64f0fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/commits/7e114b2cf389a811fcfb8d89390a1caa0de4b36c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T11:59:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T11:59:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(ui): data consistency checks and as-of average cost in the form\n\n- dataChecks.js lists sales larger than the position held, periods of\n  negative cash (with the row that covered them), storage names written\n  in several ways and buy/sell rows the engine cannot use. Shown on All\n  Transactions, Deposit Accounts and as one line on the Dashboard, with\n  a shortcut to edit each row.\n- The transaction form prices and validates a sale with the average cost\n  and quantity on its own date, and refuses edits that would leave any\n  later sale without enough quantity. Rows that were already\n  inconsistent can still be edited when the edit does not make them worse.\n- The Deposit Accounts ledger flags negative balances and shows implicit\n  capital; Securities Accounts show merged storage spellings.\n- The CSV export writes the realized P&L computed by the engine instead\n  of the value stored when the row was entered.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RT7QLEzoa8patZ52wiC4Av","tree":{"sha":"7bc00e1aee768c7686c0fd2a4ce6ae59c05e6719","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/git/trees/7bc00e1aee768c7686c0fd2a4ce6ae59c05e6719"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/git/commits/7e114b2cf389a811fcfb8d89390a1caa0de4b36c","verification":{"payload":"tree 7bc00e1aee768c7686c0fd2a4ce6ae59c05e6719\nparent 946558883ea5783231ec17d3ca0b8412a225dce5\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790510365 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790510365 +0000\n\nfeat(ui): data consistency checks and as-of average cost in the form\n\n- dataChecks.js lists sales larger than the position held, periods of\n  negative cash (with the row that covered them), storage names written\n  in several ways and buy/sell rows the engine cannot use. Shown on All\n  Transactions, Deposit Accounts and as one line on the Dashboard, with\n  a shortcut to edit each row.\n- The transaction form prices and validates a sale with the average cost\n  and quantity on its own date, and refuses edits that would leave any\n  later sale without enough quantity. Rows that were already\n  inconsistent can still be edited when the edit does not make them worse.\n- The Deposit Accounts ledger flags negative balances and shows implicit\n  capital; Securities Accounts show merged storage spellings.\n- The CSV export writes the realized P&L computed by the engine instead\n  of the value stored when the row was entered.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RT7QLEzoa8patZ52wiC4Av\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNf6qRwE\nsIvGWpLFzW+Mw3GJOC7rBbYhakkaR5Rgn+YEFs08NwKCujam9Vmq8zd/TuTR2WZmS8Bh/WOvzkyE\nKQk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T11:59:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/commit/7e114b2cf389a811fcfb8d89390a1caa0de4b36c","node_id":"C_kwDOL4mo0doAKDdlMTE0YjJjZjM4OWE4MTFmY2ZiOGQ4OTM5MGExY2FhMGRlNGIzNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/commit/946558883ea5783231ec17d3ca0b8412a225dce5","sha":"946558883ea5783231ec17d3ca0b8412a225dce5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/commits/946558883ea5783231ec17d3ca0b8412a225dce5"}],"sha":"7e114b2cf389a811fcfb8d89390a1caa0de4b36c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/commits/7e114b2cf389a811fcfb8d89390a1caa0de4b36c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/commits/946558883ea5783231ec17d3ca0b8412a225dce5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T11:59:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T11:59:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(engine): stop inventing cash and profit; one cash replay for all views\n\nThe holdings engine floored the cash balance at 0 when a purchase needed\nmore cash than recorded. That created cash that did not exist and the same\namount of profit (7.2M VND on a real log whose purchases were entered\nminutes before the deposits paying for them).\n\n- replayCash() / replay_cash(): a single replay of the VNĐ account that\n  gives the cash balance, net capital and the external flows for TTWROR\n  and IRR. With deposits in the log the balance may go negative; without\n  any (trades-only import) purchases beyond the balance count as implicit\n  capital, so realized gains and dividends reach the total P&L.\n- Total P&L = value − net capital with no clamp at 0.\n- Sales larger than the position close it; only the quantity held is\n  realized (the excess no longer shows up as profit).\n- Stablecoins without a price are valued at their rate, the USDT rate,\n  then their cost (JS returned NaN, Python used 1 VND).\n- Deposit and withdrawal rows always move VNĐ cash.\n- One chronological order for every engine: same-timestamp deposits\n  before purchases, withdrawals last.\n- Per-storage holdings match names case-insensitively and take the part\n  of a sale its account does not hold from the other accounts.\n- Python mirrors the JS rules; both produce identical holdings and P&L\n  on the audited log.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RT7QLEzoa8patZ52wiC4Av","tree":{"sha":"42d67e19630b065886f4f5b2b422d461502b3868","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/git/trees/42d67e19630b065886f4f5b2b422d461502b3868"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/git/commits/946558883ea5783231ec17d3ca0b8412a225dce5","verification":{"payload":"tree 42d67e19630b065886f4f5b2b422d461502b3868\nparent 4257cdd2c006916ca67c23ccc2b3958280c2ec48\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790510365 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790510365 +0000\n\nfix(engine): stop inventing cash and profit; one cash replay for all views\n\nThe holdings engine floored the cash balance at 0 when a purchase needed\nmore cash than recorded. That created cash that did not exist and the same\namount of profit (7.2M VND on a real log whose purchases were entered\nminutes before the deposits paying for them).\n\n- replayCash() / replay_cash(): a single replay of the VNĐ account that\n  gives the cash balance, net capital and the external flows for TTWROR\n  and IRR. With deposits in the log the balance may go negative; without\n  any (trades-only import) purchases beyond the balance count as implicit\n  capital, so realized gains and dividends reach the total P&L.\n- Total P&L = value − net capital with no clamp at 0.\n- Sales larger than the position close it; only the quantity held is\n  realized (the excess no longer shows up as profit).\n- Stablecoins without a price are valued at their rate, the USDT rate,\n  then their cost (JS returned NaN, Python used 1 VND).\n- Deposit and withdrawal rows always move VNĐ cash.\n- One chronological order for every engine: same-timestamp deposits\n  before purchases, withdrawals last.\n- Per-storage holdings match names case-insensitively and take the part\n  of a sale its account does not hold from the other accounts.\n- Python mirrors the JS rules; both produce identical holdings and P&L\n  on the audited log.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RT7QLEzoa8patZ52wiC4Av\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAa1rHap\nx4WZhv5a2vzKTR67uyKFyj7Dzal4AJu67g60gUMooIjiO9+I3fDQGH7bolH8+KG1VdETJVleQRaY\ndAg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T11:59:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id