ser","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/commits/4257cdd2c006916ca67c23ccc2b3958280c2ec48/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T06:45:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T06:45:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs: document user-owned securities, quote feeds, import and backup\n\n- New wiki page Feature-User-Securities (feeds, price rules, JSON feed\n  configuration and safety limits, CSV formats, backup, API, storage)\n- Firestore schema, API reference, frontend architecture, README and\n  CHANGELOG updated\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RT7QLEzoa8patZ52wiC4Av","tree":{"sha":"5477a99fdb57d87e2de108a1d8dfe5ad2e47dbe1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/git/trees/5477a99fdb57d87e2de108a1d8dfe5ad2e47dbe1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/git/commits/4257cdd2c006916ca67c23ccc2b3958280c2ec48","verification":{"payload":"tree 5477a99fdb57d87e2de108a1d8dfe5ad2e47dbe1\nparent 6f3c16d352222ef07b53ebb16036d226965bbfa7\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790491556 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790491556 +0000\n\ndocs: document user-owned securities, quote feeds, import and backup\n\n- New wiki page Feature-User-Securities (feeds, price rules, JSON feed\n  configuration and safety limits, CSV formats, backup, API, storage)\n- Firestore schema, API reference, frontend architecture, README and\n  CHANGELOG updated\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RT7QLEzoa8patZ52wiC4Av\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by