ation map, reporting\n  period, TTWROR / IRR / delta / drawdown formulas, \"Cổ tức\" type)\n- Rewrite Architecture-Frontend for the new structure and data flow\n- Correct the transactions API reference and document /prices/daily?limit\n- README features and project structure, CHANGELOG entries\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RT7QLEzoa8patZ52wiC4Av","tree":{"sha":"6a07a09b85f134361a52109513459574478df0e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/git/trees/6a07a09b85f134361a52109513459574478df0e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/git/commits/878a83ded37659743ab16f6b872cf562bdff5f62","verification":{"payload":"tree 6a07a09b85f134361a52109513459574478df0e5\nparent 779b34495abfefff19972533a31f98035146439c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790489597 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790489597 +0000\n\ndocs: document the Portfolio Performance style reports\n\n- New wiki page Feature-Performance-Reports (navigation map, reporting\n  period, TTWROR / IRR / delta / drawdown formulas, \"Cổ tức\" type)\n- Rewrite Architecture-Frontend for the new structure and data flow\n- Correct the transactions API reference and document /prices/daily?limit\n- README features and project structure, CHANGELOG entries\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RT7QLEzoa8patZ52wiC4Av\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKlmFqo2\nYX/NdRBaYFPm+EakiuX6XX4nYZCk8OjguPH1dzvjRdESt3gzJAg1gkMkhhnfZyKoJP3u65mpK2tK\n+QI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T06:13:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_u