v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/commits/d979ff6d06728dd4b1b5dbb3ba4b4b45a587acb9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T06:13:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T06:13:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(engine): performance engine, cash ledger and \"Cổ tức\" transactions\n\nAdd the calculation layer behind the Portfolio Performance style reports:\n- performanceEngine.js: TTWROR (cumulative + p.a.), IRR (Newton with\n  bisection fallback), absolute change, delta, max drawdown and duration,\n  volatility / semi-volatility, monthly and yearly returns, average-cost\n  trade replay, per-security performance and monthly cash flows\n- accounts.js: VNĐ cash ledger with running balance and holdings per\n  custodian, both reconciled with calculateHoldings()\n- reportingPeriod.js / dates.js: reporting period presets (1M…3Y, YTD,\n  all, custom) and date helpers\n- New transaction type \"Cổ tức\" (dividend, coupon, interest): credits cash,\n  leaves cost basis and net capital unchanged — JS engine, Python engine\n  and the TransactionCreate schema\n- GET /api/prices/daily accepts `limit` (1–1000) for price history\n- Mock market prices in tests now use VND like the backend stores them,\n  fixing the two previously failing calculator tests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RT7QLEzoa8patZ52wiC4Av","tree":{"sha":"1f4292c3e0cae53887e552f13f11e2aa75a71deb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/git/trees/1f4292c3e0cae53887e552f13f11e2aa75a71deb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/git/commits/d979ff6d06728dd4b1b5dbb3ba4b4b45a587acb9","verification":{"payload":"tree 1f4292c3e0cae53887e552f13f11e2aa75a71deb\nparent bc276437618b8fc5f905fea83227451b3af66757\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790489597 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790489597 +0000\n\nfeat(engine): performance engine, cash ledger and \"Cổ tức\" transactions\n\nAdd the calculation layer behind the Portfolio Performance style reports:\n- performanceEngine.js: TTWROR (cumulative + p.a.), IRR (Newton with\n  bisection fallback), absolute change, delta, max drawdown and duration,\n  volatility / semi-volatility, monthly and yearly returns, average-cost\n  trade replay, per-security performance and monthly cash flows\n- accounts.js: VNĐ cash ledger with running balance and holdings per\n  custodian, both reconciled with calculateHoldings()\n- reportingPeriod.js / dates.js: reporting period presets (1M…3Y, YTD,\n  all, custom) and date helpers\n- New transaction type \"Cổ tức\" (dividend, coupon, interest): credits cash,\n  leaves cost basis and net capital unchanged — JS engine, Python engine\n  and the TransactionCreate schema\n- GET /api/prices/daily accepts `limit` (1–1000) for price history\n- Mock market prices in tests now use VND like the backend stores them,\n  fixing the two previously failing calculator tests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RT7QLEzoa8patZ52wiC4Av\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDzLN7rW\nfA8pM00CfEzD33caYvgn6mCkETmOp4wjQe+gD/7QKHfrjWDjHk+M6VYZHAO42aBkCfrHf4tV6gMU\njwA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T06:13:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/commit/d979ff6d06728dd4b1b5dbb3ba4b4b45a587acb9","node_id":"C_kwDOL4mo0doAKGQ5NzlmZjZkMDY3MjhkZDRiMWI1ZGJiM2JhNGI0YjQ1YTU4N2FjYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/commit/bc276437618b8fc5f905fea83227451b3af66757","sha":"bc276437618b8fc5f905fea83227451b3af66757","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/commits/bc276437618b8fc5f905fea83227451b3af66757"}],"sha":"d979ff6d06728dd4b1b5dbb3ba4b4b45a587acb9",