 docker, testing\n- Refactored to fullstack: Python FastAPI backend + React frontend\n- Backend: auth (JWT+Firebase), Firestore CRUD, portfolio engine, price service\n- Dynamic PriceManager: tickers derived from portfolio transactions\n- CoinGecko auto-detect: unknown crypto resolved via search API\n- APScheduler: daily 9AM price fetch + snapshot for all users\n- Security: enhanced .gitignore, secrets in .env only, redacted example keys\n- README v6.0: full API reference, project structure, setup guide\n\nBuilt with AI-assisted development — Google Deepmind Antigravity Agent","tree":{"sha":"70f8ee88f06bec35e1deec78fcf41da5e11e7185","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/git/trees/70f8ee88f06bec35e1deec78fcf41da5e11e7185"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhphong1611/portfolio_assets_management/git/commits/1ee52473e1390468837ec152d2fdb876e4ad0986","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37512364?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huynhphong1611/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huynhphong1611/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huynhphong1611/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huynhphong1611/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/huynhphong1611","id":37512364,"login":"huynhphong1611","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTEyMzY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huynhphong1611/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huynhphong1611/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huynhphong1611/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huynhphong1611/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huynhphong1611/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/huynhphong1611